          "event_id": "lite_evt_00040",
          "explanation": "The doctor provided a specific, time-bound, executable plan: go to the hospital today, bring originals, ask specific questions, and if unable, go tomorrow morning.",
          "quote": "今天下午能去就去，先按护士站刚才指引办：出发前再回拨一句“下午到院应先挂手外科门诊，还是直接到原病区找主管医生？”"
        },
